{"sha": "7957e09b3cfe4687698a69a07ddcdaf5e824dc1ae9358c5755d2f8151f4889ab", "body": ["\\begin{proof}[推理]", "逆步骤从另一侧攀越同一能垒：", "以生成物为基准测得的高度比正向高出 $-\\Delta E$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[哈蒙德假设]\\label{prop:b1:elementary-steps:hammond}", "基元反应的过渡态在结构和能量上，与它", "在能量上更接近的物种相似：对于强吸热的步骤，", "过渡态像生成物；对于强放热的步骤，过渡态像反应物。", "因此，对于生成高能中间体的步骤，", "任何能使中间体稳定的因素，", "也会降低通向它的能垒。", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\section{决速步与前置平衡}", "", "\\begin{definition}[决速步]\\label{def:b1:elementary-steps:rds}", "在一系列步骤中，\\emph{决速步}\\index{决速步}", "是比其他所有步骤都慢得多的步骤；总反应速率", "等于它的速率，其余较快的步骤都随之调整，", "正如道路上的车辆都跟随最慢的那一段行进。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[前置平衡近似]\\label{def:b1:elementary-steps:pre-equilibrium}", "在\\emph{前置平衡近似}\\index{前置平衡近似}中，", "假定位于决速步之前的快速可逆步骤", "始终保持平衡：其各物种的浓度", "满足该步骤的平衡常数 $K_1 = k_1/k_{-1}$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[由前置平衡导出的速率方程]\\label{prop:b1:elementary-steps:pre-equilibrium-law}", "对于如下机理", "\\[", "  \\mathrm{A} + \\mathrm{B} \\underset{k_{-1}}{\\overset{k_1}{\\rightleftharpoons}} \\mathrm{I}", "  \\ \\text{(快)}, \\qquad", "  \\mathrm{I} + \\mathrm{C} \\xrightarrow{\\ k_2\\ } \\mathrm{P} \\ \\text{(慢)},", "\\]", "速率为 $v = k_2K_1[\\mathrm{A}][\\mathrm{B}][\\mathrm{C}]$，", "总级数为 3，表观速率常数 $k = k_1k_2/k_{-1}$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "速率即慢步骤的速率，$v = k_2[\\mathrm{I}][\\mathrm{C}]$。第一步", "保持平衡：$k_1[\\mathrm{A}][\\mathrm{B}] =", "k_{-1}[\\mathrm{I}]$，故 $[\\mathrm{I}] = K_1[\\mathrm{A}][\\mathrm{B}]$。", "代入即得结果。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{稳态近似}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[连续一级反应]\\label{thm:b1:elementary-steps:consecutive}", "对于 $\\mathrm{A} \\xrightarrow{k_1} \\mathrm{B} \\xrightarrow{k_2} \\mathrm{C}$，", "两步均为一级，且 $[\\mathrm{A}] = a_0$，$[\\mathrm{B}] =", "[\\mathrm{C}] = 0$（在 $t = 0$ 时），$k_1 \\ne k_2$：", "\\[", "  [\\mathrm{A}] = a_0\\eu^{-k_1t}, \\qquad", "  [\\mathrm{B}] = \\frac{a_0k_1}{k_2 - k_1}\\big(\\eu^{-k_1t} - \\eu^{-k_2t}\\big),", "  \\qquad [\\mathrm{C}] = a_0 - [\\mathrm{A}] - [\\mathrm{B}] .", "\\]", "中间体在 $t_{\\max} = \\dfrac{\\ln(k_2/k_1)}", "{k_2 - k_1}$ 时达到极大值。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由 $\\dd[\\mathrm{A}]/\\dd t = -k_1[\\mathrm{A}]$ 得 $[\\mathrm{A}]$。再由", "$\\dd[\\mathrm{B}]/\\dd t + k_2[\\mathrm{B}] = k_1a_0\\eu^{-k_1t}$，这是一阶", "线性方程：两边乘以 $\\eu^{k_2t}$，$\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}", "\\big([\\mathrm{B}]\\eu^{k_2t}\\big) = k_1a_0\\eu^{(k_2-k_1)t}$，", "从 0 积分（此时 $[\\mathrm{B}] = 0$），得 $[\\mathrm{B}]\\eu^{k_2t} =", "\\frac{k_1a_0}{k_2-k_1}(\\eu^{(k_2-k_1)t} - 1)$。由物质守恒得", "$[\\mathrm{C}]$。$[\\mathrm{B}]$ 的导数为零，当 $k_1\\eu^{-k_1t}", "= k_2\\eu^{-k_2t}$ 时，即在 $t_{\\max}$ 处。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[稳态近似]\\label{def:b1:elementary-steps:qssa}", "在\\emph{稳态近似}\\index{稳态近似}", "（或准稳态）中，一种反应性很强的中间体，", "其消耗速率远快于生成速率，在经过短暂的诱导期后，", "其浓度被视为恒定且很小：其生成速率", "等于其消耗速率，", "$\\dd[\\mathrm{I}]/\\dd t \\approx 0$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[稳态成立的条件]\\label{prop:b1:elementary-steps:qssa-justified}", "对于 $\\mathrm{A} \\to \\mathrm{B} \\to \\mathrm{C}$，若 $k_2 \\gg k_1$：经过", "约 $1/k_2$ 量级的时间后，$[\\mathrm{B}] \\approx k_1[\\mathrm{A}]/k_2$（这正是", "$\\dd[\\mathrm{B}]/\\dd t = 0$ 所给出的结果），$[\\mathrm{B}]$ 保持很小，生成物", "以 $\\dd[\\mathrm{C}]/\\dd t \\approx k_1[\\mathrm{A}]$ 的速率生成：", "第一步为决速步。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "当 $k_2 \\gg k_1$ 且 $t \\gg 1/k_2$ 时，$\\eu^{-k_2t}$ 与", "$\\eu^{-k_1t}$ 相比可以忽略，且 $k_2 - k_1 \\approx k_2$，故 $[\\mathrm{B}] \\approx (a_0k_1/k_2)", "\\eu^{-k_1t} = k_1[\\mathrm{A}]/k_2 \\ll [\\mathrm{A}]$。于是", "$\\dd[\\mathrm{C}]/\\dd t = k_2[\\mathrm{B}] \\approx k_1[\\mathrm{A}]$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=s,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=6, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$k_1t$}, ylabel={浓度$/a_0$},", "  title={$k_2 = 0.5\\,k_1$}, title style={font=\\small},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=t, y=a] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-slow.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=t, y=b] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-slow.dat};", "\\addplot[omMeth, thick] table[x=t, y=c] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-slow.dat};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.4,0.75) {A};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=south] at (axis cs:1.39,0.51) {B};", "\\node[omMeth, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:4.5,0.75) {C};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(s.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=1.2cm,", "  width=0.48\\linewidth, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=6, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  xlabel={$k_1t$}, ylabel={浓度$/a_0$},", "  title={$k_2 = 20\\,k_1$}, title style={font=\\small},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=t, y=a] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-fast.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=t, y=b] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-fast.dat};", "\\addplot[omMeth, thick] table[x=t, y=c] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-fast.dat};", "\\addplot[black, dashed] table[x=t, y=bss] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-consecutive-reactions-fast.dat};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.4,0.32) {A};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:2,0.22) {B（稳态，虚线）};", "\\node[omMeth, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:4.5,0.85) {C};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}